---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout pageTitle="colophon">
  <section>
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Colophon</h1>
      <div class="content">
        <p>
          This project was built using <strong>Astro</strong>, a Javascript framework I've loved working with so far. Hosting and deployment are handled by <strong>Vercel</strong>. My editor of choice
          is <strong>Visual Studio Code</strong> and I mostly use <strong>Hyper</strong> as my terminal.
        </p>
        <p>
          I used <strong>Figma</strong> to visualize what I wanted this website to look like. I deliberately wanted to keep it relatively simple because I'm a terribly picky person when it comes to things
          like this and keep more challenging (and exciting) layouts and designs for the projects I'm planning to do.
          <br />
          The fonts I use are Averia Serif Libre and Open Sans, both from <strong>Google Fonts</strong>. UI icons are from <strong>Lucide</strong>.
        </p>
        <p>
          I don't use AI to generate code or content for my website, because I want it to feel handmade and personal to me and because I simply have the skillset to do it myself. Hold up, I'm not
          judging you if you do use AI for your website or projects! I think it's a great tool to give people the power to create things that didn't seem doable before. It's a nuanced topic, so I will
          probably make a blog post about it someday.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Changelog</h2>
      <ol class="changelog-list">
        <li><strong>25-08-2026</strong>: added reviews page to extend media/library pages (no reviews yet tho)</li>
        <li><strong>22-08-2026</strong>: added a library page with the full list of consumed media, grouped by year and type</li>
        <li><strong>17-08-2026</strong>: media page was added! initially, this page is just a straight-forward list of entries, but it will be extended soon</li>
        <li><strong>06-08-2026</strong>: "about" page was removed and content was moved to homepage, also added a proper h-card to footer</li>
        <li><strong>05-08-2026</strong>: added microformats for blog posts</li>
        <li><strong>26-01-2026</strong>: website rebirth yay!</li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style lang="scss">
  h1 {
    padding-top: clamp(30px, 5vh, 60px);
  }

  .changelog-list {
    ol,
    li {
      list-style: none;
      padding: 0;
    }

    li {
      line-height: 1.7;
    }
  }
</style>
